   "title": "An Appetite for Figures",
   "turnin": "r14_dwarf_steward",
   "xp": 340
  },
  {
   "copper": 10,
   "description": "Another page chewed, another bounty posted; at least this expense is easy to explain. Kill six Granary Rats in the Copperfell Lower Pines at night, then return for payment. This bounty is repeatable twenty minutes after you hand it in.",
