   "xp": 225
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "Speak to Mara Deepwatch at Copperfell Outpost and tell her Orrik sent you; her latest request for help uses the word 'urgent' hard enough to tear the paper. I'd send a clerk, but she was quite specific about the axe.",
   "giver": "r14_dwarf_steward",
