   "xp": 95
  },
  {
   "copper": 23,
   "description": "A cart wheel went through the ground, and I've no wish to see a carter follow it. Hunt eight Burrow Gnawers after dark on the Copperfell Pine Slopes, which lie in the heart of Copperfell Foothills. They tunnel while we sleep; tonight we interrupt the shift.",
