   "copper": 23,
   "description": "The last carter to refuse their 'road toll' came back without his cart. Go to the Copperfell Bandit Camp east from here and defeat eight outlaws in all, counting Roadside Bandits and Bandit Lookouts. Use cover to close on the lookouts; an arrow doesn't care how stout your argument is.",
