   "description": "They tied my hands, not my ears; I heard the bandits selling our ore to the goblins at the Copperfell Goblin Dig west from here. Defeat eight of the dig's guards in all, counting Rubble Goblin Slingers and Ore-Guard Hounds. The slingers throw rocks and the hounds rush in, so don't let one distract you from the other.",
