  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "Goblin Foreman Nog pays his crew out of Stolen Purses, which makes every carter here an unwilling investor. Bring back three Stolen Purses from Rubble Goblin Slingers at the Copperfell Goblin Dig and kill Nog himself there. Draw him away from his crew if you can. I'd like our wages back without owing you a funeral.",
